    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "CONTINENTAL ARISED",
      "PREMIUM SPIRITS AND COCKTAILS\nScotch Whiskey\nLight Rum:\nGin or Vodka Martini:\nWine Spritzer\nDry Sherry\nCanadian Whiskey\nKentucky Bourbon\nTennessee Sour Mash\nGin\nGin and Tonic\nBloody Mary\nDomestic Beers\nScrewdriver\nWINES AND CHAMPAGNE\nPremium California wines and champagne are available for your dining pleasure\nYour Flight Attendant will advise you of today's selection.\nAFTER DINNER LIQUEURS\nGrand Marnier\nHennessy VSOP\nKahlua\nAmaretto di Saronno\nDrambuie\nBenedictine \u0026 Brandy\nCreme de Menthe\nBEVERAGES, COFFEES AND TEAS\nCoca-Cola • Tab • 7 Up • Diet 7 Up • Ginger Ale • Quinine • Club Soda\nFreshly brewed Coffee • Sanka • Tea • Milk\nPlease accept our apology if your choice of food or beverage is not available. The variety limits the quantity.\nWe invite you to make your own fixin's from\nour Chef's special selections or, if you prefer, your Flight Attendant will\ngladly assist you in 'creating a sandwich or coldplate.\nTODAY WE ARE FEATURING\nChoice Roast Beef®\nHickory Smoked Country Ham\nSliced Breast of Turkey\nGenoa Salami\nSouthern Fried Chicken\nServed with\nTomato Slices - Crisp Romaine Lettuce\n- Celery \u0026 Carrot Sticks\nCreamy Peanut Butter Currant Jelly - Assorted Cheeses\nAssortment of Freshly Baked Breads and Rolls\nDessert Treats\nB3/4-111"
    ],
